<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Nodejs Addon - 標籤 | 奇風歲月</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/nodejs-addon/</link><description>独立开发者 Travis Bikkle 的个人博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.138.0 &amp; FixIt v0.3.15-fd15415b</generator><language>zh-hant</language><managingEditor>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</managingEditor><webMaster>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2024 06:25:21 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/nodejs-addon/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Electron 中文搜索</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2024/07/chinese-search/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 Jul 2024 10:22:28 +0800</pubDate><author>travisbikkle@proton.me (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2024/07/chinese-search/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/categories/front-end/">Front-End</category><description>&lt;p>這篇文章快速演示如何使用 js-search, nodejieba（結巴）來在 Electron 中實現中文搜索。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>它快速，實時，比你見過的任何一種搜索都快，快到爆漿。&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>tech&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>version&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>electron&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>30.0.6&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
